  },
  {
    "statement": "Non-chemical treatments like freshwater bathing provide mixed results for disease control.",
    "citations": [
      "739"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Studies in Australia showed mixed evidence for freshwater bathing reducing amoebic gill disease.",
    "citations": [
      "739"
